the search party returned to the Northwest Community Hospital, where they learned Stanley Janus had since passed away. His wife, Theresa, was in an extremely critical and unstable condition. MUSIC That same night, Arlington Heights Fire Lieutenant Philip Capatelli received a phone call from his mother-in-law, Marge. The daughter of her friend, Gina Kellerman, had died suddenly that morning, and she sought an explanation for the tragedy. The Kellermans lived in the neighbouring suburb of Elk Grove Village, so Philip rang a fellow
搜查队返回西北社区医院，在那里他们得知斯坦利·扬纳斯已经去世。他的妻子特蕾莎情况极其危急且不稳定。音乐 当天晚上，阿灵顿海茨消防中队长菲利普·卡帕特利接到岳母玛吉打来的电话。她朋友吉娜·克勒曼的女儿那天早上突然去世了，她想为这场悲剧寻求一个解释。克勒曼一家住在邻近的埃尔克格罗夫村郊区，于是菲利普打电话给一位在当地工作的同行

10
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:48.000
firefighter who worked in the region, Richard Keyworth. Richard was aware of the incident, as earlier that day he made an impromptu visit to his fire station to collect some mail, and while there, overheard radio chatter about the peculiar death of 12-year-old Mary Kellerman. Hours earlier, as dawn broke at 6.30, a feverish Mary complained to her parents that she had a sore throat, runny nose, and headache. Dennis and Gina Kellerman decided to keep her home from school, and gave her one extra strength Tylenol to ease her discomfort.
消防员理查德·凯沃思。理查德知道这起事件，因为那天早些时候他临时去消防站取信，并在那里无意中听到无线电广播讨论12岁女孩玛丽·克勒曼离奇死亡的消息。几个小时前，即清晨6点30分，发烧的玛丽向父母抱怨她喉咙痛、流鼻涕和头痛。丹尼斯和吉娜·克勒曼决定让她在家休息不上学，并给了她一粒强力泰诺来缓解不适。

11
00:07:48.000 --> 00:08:35.000
A short while later, Dennis heard a heavy thud emanate from the bathroom and went to investigate, finding his pajama-clad daughter unconscious on the floor. By the time paramedics arrived, Mary was in full cardiac arrest. She was rushed to Alexian Brothers Medical Centre, where she died at 9.56am. Heart attack, stroke, and an undiagnosed terminal condition were opted as possible causes of death, with more sinister speculation centred on the Kellerman family. An investigator interviewed Mary's father, and the police visited their home, but they uncovered nothing out of order.
不久之后，丹尼斯听到浴室传出一声沉闷的巨响，便去查看，发现身穿睡衣的女儿昏迷不倒在地上。救护车赶到时，玛丽已经完全心脏骤停。她被紧急送往阿莱克ian兄弟医疗中心，并于上午9点56分去世。心脏病发作、中风和未诊断出的绝症被选为可能的死因，而更阴险的猜测则集中在克勒曼一家身上。一名调查员采访了玛丽的父亲，警察也走访了他们的家，但他们没有发现任何异常。

